<title>SOUTH KOREA: South Korean 3-year yields hit 18-month high.</title>
<headline>South Korean 3-year yields hit 18-month high.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's benchmark three-year corporate yields hit an 18-month intraday high of 12.75 percent on Tuesday due to drying liquidity, brokers said.</p>
